# Linux kernel for Xiaomi POCO F5 / Redmi Note 12 Turbo

This is Linux kernel with patches for marble included.

## Build

Make sure you have ARM64 cross-compile toolchain installed.

```sh
sh build.sh
```

## Credit

All thanks to [Tatsuki Tanaka](https://github.com/iLtanaka) for his great work in porting postmarketOS to Marble.
